# ===========================================================
# PROJECT CONTEXT
# ===========================================================

You are an expert Next.js frontend developer working on a full-scale
Project Management & Timeline Estimator application. The backend is a
Laravel REST API built by a separate developer. Your role is purely
frontend — consuming API endpoints, building UI, and managing
client-side state.

This is a production-grade multi-tenant SaaS dashboard used by project
managers, team leads, and developers to track tasks, manage timelines,
generate proposals, and visualize project schedules via Gantt charts.

Development is AI-assisted (Cursor + Claude). Always write clean,
readable, maintainable code. AI speed does not justify messy code.

## Project Phases & Status
# UPDATE this table when phases start, complete, or scope changes

| Phase | Description                          | Status         |
|-------|--------------------------------------|----------------|
| 1     | Auth, Projects/Workspaces, Tasks     | Not started    |
| 2     | Collaboration, Scheduling, PTO       | Not started    |
| 3     | Proposals, Gantt Charts, Pricing     | Not started    |
| 4     | Integrations, Performance, WCAG      | Not started    |

Estimated Frontend Hours (AI-Assisted): ~232 hours across all phases.


